//RS /// Interpreter host for the canonical HTTP substrate: the same
//RS /// HTTPMessage/NetHTTP/HTTPServer/WebServerFn/Ws sources AOT concatenates and
//RS /// the resident JIT includes in `net_http_rt`. `web_kernel` (App.rs) imports
//RS /// the App mux entries from here, exactly as the JIT's `web_rt` does. Every
//RS /// item defined in this module is a marshalling row; behavior lives in the
//RS /// included files. Dead-code reports here are about other hosts' usage, and
//RS /// `private_interfaces` is the flat AOT namespace's `pub(crate)` grammar
//RS /// landing in a nested module.
